# ── derived artifacts: machine-written, never hand-edited, never a source of truth ──
# (README-FIRST: the databases ARE the authority; these are copies that churn on a timer)
factory/index/index.json
factory/index/index.tsv
factory/index/stats.json
factory/index/build.log
factory/spec-export/specs.csv
factory/spec-export/specs.meta.json
factory/spec-export/watch.log
factory/team-log/**
# ...except the documents worth keeping: the proposals, and the receipts of rows
# actually written into the spec database. Everything else (per-turn transcripts,
# LATEST-reply.md) stays out. Match case-insensitively so a receipt cannot be
# dropped by capitalisation.
!factory/team-log/SPEC-PROPOSAL-*.md
!factory/team-log/[Ll][Oo][Aa][Dd][Ee][Dd]-*.sql
factory/fusion-harness/**/*.bak-*
factory/fusion-harness/*.bak-*
